[[File:RazorCrest-TMUSC.png|thumb|right|300px|The ''Razor Crest'', a pre-Empire era gunship.]]
{{Quote|What difference does it make now? The Separatists know we're involved.''"<br />"''I don't disagree with you Anakin, but to send in Republic gunships defeats our purpose.|[[Anakin Skywalker]] and [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] debate the [[Onderonian Civil War]]|<ref name="Tipping Points">{{TCW|Tipping Points}}</ref>}}
A '''gunship''' was a class of vessel used by military forces. Usually equipped with heavy armament and mainly used for offensive operations, several models of gunship could also fill the role of a [[troop transport]]. The term applied to both [[starship]]s and atmospheric [[repulsorcraft]]. During the [[Clone Wars]], the [[Galactic Republic|Republic's]] [[Grand Army of the Republic|army]] often made use of the [[Low Altitude Assault Transport/infantry|Low Altitude Assault Transport]],<ref name="TCW Film">[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars (film)|''Star Wars: The Clone Wars'' film]]</ref> also named the Republic attack gunship.<ref name="Republic attack gunship">{{Databank|republic-attack-gunship|Republic Attack Gunship}}</ref> Its lightly armed cousin, the [[LAAT/le patrol gunship]], was used as a patrol craft for [[Coruscant Security Force|police forces]] on [[Coruscant]]<ref name="To Catch a Jedi">{{TCW|To Catch a Jedi}}</ref> and other worlds.<ref name="Call to Action">{{Rebels|Call to Action}}</ref> The [[Auzituck anti-slaver gunship|''Auzituck'' anti-slaver gunship]] was manufactured by the [[Wookiee]]s of [[Kashyyyk]] to fight off [[enslaver]]s that frequently attacked their world.<ref name="rebelsvisual">''[[Star Wars Rebels: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> The ''[[Razor Crest]]'' was a pre-[[Galactic Empire|Empire]] era military patrol gunship that was owned by [[Mandalorian]] [[bounty hunter]], [[Din Djarin]].<ref name="Razor Crest">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 1: The Mandalorian}}</ref> The [[TIE/es assault shuttle]] was a model of gunship<ref name="Smuggler's Run">{{GEAttr|Millennium Falcon: Smuggler's Run}}</ref> and [[assault shuttle]] used by the [[First Order]].<ref name="SWGE">{{GEAttr|First Order Cargo}}</ref>

